DESCRIPTION:SCALE: MAJOR\n\n700+ student organizations\, club sports\, Gree
 k life\, cultural orgs and Divine 9/MGC tabling along College Ave. Free\, 
 no RSVP. Street closures 6am-9pm: College Ave (Senior to Hamilton)\, Morre
 ll St\, Bartlett St\, Seminary Pl. Lots 9\, 25\, 35 closed. Rain date list
 ed as 'Monday\, August 30' on the SCA page\, an internal error - presumed 
 Mon Aug 31\, unconfirmed.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: CLOSED to outside companies - 
 SCA states non-student groups and departments cannot be accommodated. BUT 
 sponsorship is open: 2026-27 packages at rutgers.ca1.qualtrics.com/jfe/for
 m/SV_6lqc6AVJF635KHY\, contact involvementfair@echo.rutgers.edu. This is t
 he realistic path to presence at the largest student-traffic event of the 
 term.\n\nSOURCE: https://sca.rutgers.edu/campus-involvement/traditions-and
 -signature-programs/involvement-fair\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-10. Verify befor
